WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.240
- Here's a tip for remembering

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.110
which amendments to the
constitution do what,

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:05.200
specifically the prohibition amendments.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.970
Now I will never forget
which amendment does what,

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:11.090
what institutes prohibition
and what repeals prohibition,

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.640
because I have a mnemonic.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.820
Specifically, I know that the amendment

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.440
that created prohibition
was the 18th amendment

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.730
because 18 years old used to
be the drinking age in America

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.060
but it's not any more.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.280
So that is what got rid of drinking.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:26.650
And I know that the 21st amendment

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.410
is the one that repealed prohibition

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:31.240
because that is the current
drinking age in America.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.860
So now you know and you will never forget

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:33.840
which amendment does what

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:36.543
with respect to prohibition
and drinking in America.

